<aside class="calculator-notice" aria-labelledby="calculator-notice-title">
  <svg class="calculator-notice__icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="13" /><path d="M16 14 V23 M16 9 V10" /></svg>
  <div class="calculator-notice__body">
    <h2 id="calculator-notice-title">Guidance, not an official classification</h2>
    <p>This independent calculator reproduces the logic of published Slovak documents.
      Use it to understand the requirements, then check the result against the official
      workbook and a formal risk analysis. The system operator remains responsible
      for its classification.</p>
    <p>Two things to know about what it models. The U1&ndash;U4 levels come from a MIRRI
      methodological guideline, not from a decree, and the C/I/A&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;category
      chain they rest on came from vyhl&aacute;&scaron;ka 179/2020, which
      <strong>vyhl&aacute;&scaron;ka 184/2026 repeals with effect from 1&nbsp;January&nbsp;2027</strong>.
      From that date categories attach to the governing body rather than to the system, and
      measures follow a risk analysis. MIRRI has not yet published guidance bridging the two.</p>
    <p>So treat the result as an illustration of how the classification has been done, not as a
      determination. A real classification should be confirmed by the organisation&rsquo;s
      <strong>manaž&eacute;r kybernetickej bezpe&ccaron;nosti</strong> or a certified
      <em>aud&iacute;tor kybernetickej bezpe&ccaron;nosti</em>.</p>
    <details>
      <summary>Source documents <span>4 references</span></summary>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Workbook</dt><dd>MIRRI SR — <em>Určenie parametrov UxCxIxAx</em>, príloha č. 1, v10.0</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Guidance</dt><dd>MIRRI SR — <em>Metodické usmernenie pre klasifikáciu ISVS</em>, 023107/2023/oSBATA-1</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Act</dt><dd>Zákon č. 69/2018 Z. z. o kybernetickej bezpečnosti, §20</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Decree</dt><dd>Vyhláška č. 165/2018 Z. z. — kritériá kategórií incidentov</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </details>
  </div>
